    "text": "<p>A particle is placed at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> of a frictionless track <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ABC</mi></math> as shown in figure. It is gently pushed towards right. The speed of the particle when it reaches the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo></math>Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9b179c38-6291-497f-abe6-f036b3493e88.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 147px;\"/>",
