  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9b179c38-6291-497f-abe6-f036b3493e88.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 147px;\"/></p><p>Applying conservation of mechanical energy between point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> &amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(1)=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>g</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
